WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Twelve minutes on the clock. An hour in the headline. Are they the same?

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:13.000
The seller describes a short meditation audio program with levels and different sound styles.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Those are features. A claim that it equals advanced meditation is a different matter.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:27.000
A scientific review of binaural beats found inconsistent EEG evidence and did not test Zen12.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Before buying, try a free twelve-minute listening ritual and notice your preferences.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:40.000
An experience can be useful. Evidence still matters. Follow the sources, not a promise.
